.TH ROCKET 1
.SH NAME
rocket \- rocket landing toy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/rocket
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Rocket
is a rocket landing toy.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Space blasts off a two-mass rocket; wasd or the arrows thrust. Enter resets.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B space
Blast off
.TP
.B Up / w
Thrust up
.TP
.B Left / a
Thrust left
.TP
.B Right / d
Thrust right
.TP
.B Enter
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/rocket.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR ode (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
